WEBVTT

00:02.544 --> 00:03.336
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:03.420 --> 00:05.004
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:05.088 --> 00:07.298
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:07.382 --> 00:09.175
Kids:   Aye, aye,
Captain!
孩子们：是啊是啊
队长！

00:09.259 --> 00:11.970
Captain: ♪ Ohh... ♪
队长：♪ 哦...♪

00:12.053 --> 00:14.222
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:14.305 --> 00:15.932
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:16.015 --> 00:18.226
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:18.309 --> 00:20.395
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:20.478 --> 00:22.939
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:23.022 --> 00:24.858
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:24.941 --> 00:26.276
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:26.359 --> 00:28.194
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:28.278 --> 00:29.446
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:29.529 --> 00:30.530
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:30.613 --> 00:33.116
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.199 --> 00:34.534
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:34.617 --> 00:38.455
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:54.804 --> 00:55.847
Man: Ohh...
男：哦……

00:55.930 --> 00:58.641
I just can't decide
what to order.
我就是无法决定
订购什么。

00:58.725 --> 01:00.143
You already ordered.
你已经订购了。

01:00.226 --> 01:02.061
Don't rush me, young lady!
别催我，年轻的女士！

01:02.145 --> 01:04.022
Hurry up, SpongeBob!
快点，海绵宝宝！

01:06.441 --> 01:09.068
What is taking you so long?
是什么让你花了这么长时间？

01:09.152 --> 01:11.821
I'm adding the love.
我正在添加爱。

01:11.905 --> 01:14.365
You're not being  paid  to love.
付钱给你不是为了爱。

01:14.449 --> 01:16.075
I'm not in it for the money.
我不是为了钱。

01:16.159 --> 01:20.830
I'll always treasure
this time we've had together.
我会永远珍惜
这次我们在一起了。

01:21.164 --> 01:22.373
Look!
看！

01:31.925 --> 01:34.344
SpongeBob: Aww...
海绵宝宝：哇……

01:34.552 --> 01:36.888
Well, I'll be cooked in butter.
好吧，我会用黄油煮。

01:36.971 --> 01:40.725
It's Jim, me original fry cook.
我是吉姆，我原来的油炸厨师。

01:40.809 --> 01:42.393
Krabs!
螃蟹们！

01:42.477 --> 01:43.728
The  Jim?
吉姆？

01:44.020 --> 01:47.774
He-Who-Flipped-Krabby-Patties
in The Before Time?
他翻转蟹肉饼
在之前的时间？

01:47.857 --> 01:49.526
You're doing well, Jim.
你做得很好，吉姆。

01:49.609 --> 01:53.488
Is, is, is that limo solid gold?
是、是、那辆豪华轿车是纯金的吗？

01:53.571 --> 01:55.406
It sure is.
确实如此。

01:55.490 --> 01:58.868
I was on my way
to my solid gold mansion
next to my solid gold lake
我正在路上
to my solid gold mansion
next to my solid gold lake

01:59.035 --> 02:01.287
when I thought I'd take
a little trip down memory lane.
当我以为我会采取
沿着记忆的小路走一趟。

02:01.371 --> 02:03.039
Good old Jim.
好老吉姆。

02:03.122 --> 02:06.417
When you worked here,
the place had class.
当你在这里工作时，
这个地方有课。

02:06.709 --> 02:10.046
Yeah, when this place
had class...
是的，当这个地方
上课了...

02:45.164 --> 02:47.917
we've had some great times, too,
right, Squidward?
我们也度过了一段美好的时光
对吧，章鱼哥？

02:48.001 --> 02:48.668
No.
不。

02:48.751 --> 02:49.752
Hey, that's new.
嘿，这是新的。

02:49.836 --> 02:51.421
Employee of the month, huh?
本月最佳员工吧？

02:51.504 --> 02:53.256
That's me!
这就是我！

02:53.339 --> 02:54.841
Krabs: Don't worry, Jim.
蟹老板：别担心，吉姆。

02:54.924 --> 02:56.801
No one could ever
take your place.
从来没有人能够
取代你的位置。

02:56.885 --> 02:58.803
The original
is still underneath.
原来的
还在下面。

03:04.517 --> 03:07.395
your "Best Employee Ever" award.
您的“最佳员工”奖。

03:07.478 --> 03:12.025
SpongeBob, sweep up this mess
while Jim and I catch up.
海绵宝宝，清理这个烂摊子
吉姆和我迎头赶上。

03:13.151 --> 03:15.320
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

03:15.403 --> 03:19.532
After I left the Krusty Krab,
I worked at some of the finest
restaurants around the world.
当我离开蟹堡王后
我曾在一些最优秀的公司工作过
世界各地的餐厅。

03:19.616 --> 03:23.411
I got so successful,
I was able to retire in luxury.
我如此成功，
我能够奢侈地退休。

03:23.494 --> 03:25.788
Would you sign my Krabby Patty?
你愿意签下我的蟹黄派吗？

03:27.582 --> 03:29.834
Oh, I don't sign
what I didn't make.
哦，我不签
我没有做的。

03:32.086 --> 03:36.633
Hey, big shot, why don't you
step behind the fryer,
for old time's sake?
嘿，大佬，你为什么不呢？
走到油炸锅后面，
为了旧时光？

03:36.716 --> 03:38.301
You're on, Krabs.
蟹蟹，你来了。

03:38.384 --> 03:39.552
But I'll have to charge you.
但我得向你收费。

03:47.268 --> 03:50.146
Oh, oh, you always knew
how to make me laugh.
哦，哦，你一直都知道
如何让我笑。

03:50.229 --> 03:54.859
You just don't find employees
like that anymore.
你只是找不到员工
不再这样了。

03:54.943 --> 03:59.489
Yeah, not unless you looked
right in front of you!
是的，除非你看
right in front of you!

04:02.116 --> 04:04.410
I appreciate you, Squidward.
我很感激你，章鱼哥。

04:04.494 --> 04:07.288
Now I feel complete.
现在我感觉很完整。

04:07.372 --> 04:08.498
Now how's about that Patty?
现在帕蒂怎么样了？

04:08.581 --> 04:12.085
Everyone, watch and learn.
大家一起来观看、学习吧。

04:13.378 --> 04:15.254
No one watches Jim.
没有人看吉姆。

04:16.506 --> 04:19.425
One Patty, the  right  way.
一个帕蒂，正确的方式。

04:22.887 --> 04:26.683
it's a thing of beauty.
这是一件美丽的事情。

04:27.725 --> 04:29.686
What's so great
about a Jim Patty, anyway?
有什么了不起
无论如何，关于吉姆·帕蒂？

04:32.355 --> 04:34.190
Eh, it's O.K.
呃，没关系。

04:56.212 --> 04:57.964
Wow...
哇...

04:58.047 --> 05:00.717
That was...  amazing.
那真是……太棒了。

05:01.467 --> 05:03.594
Um, Mr. Jim, sir?
嗯，吉姆先生，先​​生？

05:03.678 --> 05:05.638
Oh, hey... You.
哦，嘿...你。

05:05.847 --> 05:08.808
You're the...
Guy who sweeps up, right?
你是那个...
扫地的家伙，对吗？

05:08.891 --> 05:10.476
I'm the new fry cook, sir.
先生，我是新来的炒菜厨师。

05:10.560 --> 05:12.103
Oh.
哦。

05:12.186 --> 05:14.147
You made that stepped-on thing
I saw earlier, right?
你创造了那个被踩到的东西
我很早就看到了，对吧？

05:14.230 --> 05:16.816
Do you have any tips
you could pass on to a rookie?
你有什么建议吗
你可以传授给新人吗？

05:16.899 --> 05:19.569
Hmm, besides
don't step on the food?
嗯，除此之外
不要踩到食物吗？

05:19.652 --> 05:21.988
Please critique my work!
请批评我的作品！

05:22.071 --> 05:25.491
I wish to learn
at the feet of the master!
我想学习
在主人脚下！

05:25.575 --> 05:27.326
Now that's the way to grovel.
现在这就是卑躬屈膝的方式。

05:27.410 --> 05:29.287
Jim: I'll do it.
吉姆：我会做的。

05:41.758 --> 05:45.219
Yep, pickle slices
were too thick.
是的，泡菜片
太厚了。

05:47.597 --> 05:49.515
Hold it...
坚持住...

05:49.599 --> 05:50.558
Hold it...
坚持住...

05:50.641 --> 05:52.435
Hold it.
握住它。

05:53.936 --> 05:54.979
O.K.
好的。

05:57.065 --> 06:00.818
Nope, too much mustard, see?
不，芥末太多了，明白吗？

06:33.434 --> 06:34.727
Aw, man,
噢，伙计，

06:34.811 --> 06:36.729
Am I a fraud?
我是骗子吗？

06:41.818 --> 06:43.319
SpongeBob, what are you
doing in there?
海绵宝宝，你是什么
在那里做什么？

06:43.402 --> 06:46.280
Crying my eyes out.
哭得我眼睛都肿了。

06:46.364 --> 06:48.741
Well, hurry up,
I gotta cry, too.
嗯，快点，
我也得哭了

06:48.825 --> 06:50.409
Why, Squidward?
为什么，章鱼哥？

06:50.493 --> 06:52.954
Because when Jim leaves,
I'll be stuck with  you  again.
因为当吉姆离开时
我会再次和你纠缠在一起。

06:53.037 --> 06:54.330
Don't worry Squidward.
别担心，章鱼哥。

06:54.413 --> 06:56.290
Jim won't be leaving.
吉姆不会离开。

06:56.374 --> 06:58.000
He's taking my job.
他抢走了我的工作。

06:58.084 --> 06:59.669
I'm the one who's leaving.
我就是那个要离开的人。

07:00.962 --> 07:02.421
Really?
真的吗？

07:02.505 --> 07:04.132
Yes!
是的！

07:04.215 --> 07:07.176
Hot-cha-cha, hot-cha-cha,
hot-cha-cha-cha-cha-cha-cha!
热恰恰，热恰恰，
热恰恰！

07:07.260 --> 07:10.471
Ooh!
哦！

07:13.683 --> 07:17.520
The Krusty Krab deserves better
than my meager skills.
蟹堡王值得更好的
比我微薄的技能。

07:17.603 --> 07:18.771
I should be professional.
我应该是专业的。

07:18.855 --> 07:21.023
I must... resign.
我必须……辞职。

07:22.650 --> 07:25.736
"Dear Mr. Krabs..."
“亲爱的蟹老板……”

07:27.363 --> 07:30.199
Krabs: Three cheers for
the world's greatest fry cook!
蟹蟹：欢呼三声
世界上最伟大的油炸厨师！

07:30.283 --> 07:31.868
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

07:34.036 --> 07:36.873
Come here,
help us cheer for Jim.
来这里，
帮助我们为吉姆加油。

07:36.956 --> 07:37.874
Hip, hip...
臀，臀……

07:37.957 --> 07:39.792
All: Hooray!
全体：万岁！

07:39.876 --> 07:40.793
Hip, hip...
臀，臀……

07:40.877 --> 07:41.961
Hooray!
万岁！

07:42.044 --> 07:43.212
Krabs: Hip, hip...
螃蟹：嘻嘻，嘻嘻……

07:43.296 --> 07:46.632
All: Hooray!
全体：万岁！

07:46.716 --> 07:48.718
Good-bye, grill.
再见，烧烤。

07:48.801 --> 07:51.554
Good-bye, pot.
Good-bye, pan.
再见，锅。
再见，潘。

07:51.637 --> 07:53.639
So long, fry fat.
这么久了，炒脂肪。

07:53.723 --> 07:55.766
Good-bye, grease stain.
再见，油渍。

07:55.850 --> 07:57.768
Good-bye,
frozen patty number one.
再见，
冷冻肉饼排名第一。

07:57.852 --> 07:59.812
Good-bye,
frozen patty number two.
再见，
二号冷冻肉饼。

08:00.563 --> 08:04.233
Narrator: 298 frozen patties
later...
旁白：298块冷冻肉饼
后来...

08:05.026 --> 08:05.985
Good-bye, freezer.
再见，冰箱。

08:06.068 --> 08:08.154
Krabs: SpongeBob?
蟹蟹：海绵宝宝？

08:08.905 --> 08:11.324
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

08:13.075 --> 08:15.161
That smells like
a resignation letter.
闻起来像
辞职信。

08:19.624 --> 08:21.709
SpongeBob's resignation!
海绵宝宝辞职了！

08:21.792 --> 08:22.835
Oh, this is terrible.
哦，这太可怕了。

08:22.919 --> 08:24.795
No one's making patties.
没有人做馅饼。

08:24.879 --> 08:27.256
And that means
I'm not making money!
这意味着
我不赚钱！

08:27.340 --> 08:31.135
Hey, Eugene, where's that
little fry cook of yours?
嘿，尤金，那是哪里
你家的小厨师吗？

08:31.219 --> 08:34.138
He thinks you're taking his job,
so he's run off.
他认为你抢走了他的工作
所以他逃跑了。

08:34.222 --> 08:36.849
Hey, great idea,
and you can give me a raise.
嘿，好主意，
你可以给我加薪。

08:40.228 --> 08:42.146
SpongeBob: Look at them.
海绵宝宝：看看他们。

08:42.230 --> 08:45.483
Mr. Krabs is probably offering
Jim my job right now.
蟹老板可能会提供
吉姆现在是我的工作。

08:48.861 --> 08:50.905
Well, I better go find him.
好吧，我最好去找他。

08:51.822 --> 08:53.282
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

08:53.366 --> 08:56.077
Don't worry, Mr. Krabs,
I was just leaving.
别担心，蟹老板，
我正要离开。

08:56.160 --> 08:59.789
I'm not fit to inhabit
the same kitchen as Jim.
我不适合居住
和吉姆同一个厨房。

08:59.872 --> 09:04.043
So it is with a heavy heart
that I relinquish my position
as fry cook.
所以心情沉重
我放弃我的立场
作为炒菜。

09:04.126 --> 09:05.836
What are you
thinking, SpongeBob?
你是什么
海绵宝宝在想吗？

09:05.920 --> 09:07.255
I'm not taking your job.
我不会抢你的工作。

09:07.338 --> 09:10.049
But you're the greatest fry cook
in the world.
但你是最棒的炒菜厨师
在世界上。

09:10.132 --> 09:13.219
The Krusty Krab
deserves better than me.
蟹堡王
值得比我更好。

09:13.302 --> 09:16.305
Both those statements
are true, SpongeBob.
这两种说法
是真的，海绵宝宝。

09:16.389 --> 09:19.183
But there's a reason why
I left the Krusty Krab.
但有一个原因
我离开了蟹堡王。

09:19.267 --> 09:22.144
It all started
on a warm summer evening.
一切都开始了
在一个温暖的夏日傍晚。

09:22.228 --> 09:24.230
Jim: Business was slow
吉姆：业务进展缓慢

09:24.313 --> 09:27.066
so Squidward and I were having
one of our famous bull sessions.
所以章鱼哥和我在一起
我们著名的牛市之一。

09:27.149 --> 09:31.821
We should open
our own restaurant and stop
lining old man K's pockets.
我们应该打开
我们自己的餐厅和车站
衬在老K的口袋里。

09:31.904 --> 09:33.364
No, thanks.
不，谢谢。

09:33.447 --> 09:36.575
I'm just doing this until
my clarinet career takes off.
我只是这样做直到
我的单簧管事业起飞了。

09:36.659 --> 09:38.202
What if it never does?
如果它永远不会发生怎么办？

09:38.286 --> 09:40.871
Don't you want to have something
to fall back on?
你不想拥有一些东西吗
依靠？

09:40.955 --> 09:42.748
Yeah, ha!
是啊，哈！

09:42.832 --> 09:48.087
I could lose my beautiful
flowing hair too, but I'm not
buying a wig yet.
我可能会失去我的美丽
头发也飘逸，但我不是
还没买假发呢。

09:50.798 --> 09:55.845
Well, while you go wig shopping,
I'm gonna go talk to Mr. Krabs.
好吧，当你去买假发时，
我要去跟蟹老板谈谈

09:55.928 --> 09:57.596
Hey, Mr. Krabs.
嘿，蟹老板。

09:57.680 --> 09:58.889
You got a second?
你还有时间吗？

09:58.973 --> 10:00.766
Anything for you,
Jimmy me boy.
为你做任何事，
吉米我的孩子。

10:00.850 --> 10:02.893
Cop a squat and lay your racket.
深蹲并放下球拍。

10:02.977 --> 10:04.270
Tell me what's on your wig, Jim.
告诉我你的假发上有什么，吉姆。

10:04.353 --> 10:07.189
Cut the gas, Krabs,
and dig this.
关掉油门，螃蟹，
并挖掘这个。

10:07.273 --> 10:09.108
I've been
busting my conch for you.
我去过
为你打破我的海螺。

10:09.191 --> 10:12.695
You better lay on some
extra gravy, or I'm gonna
agitate the gravel.
你最好躺上一些
额外的肉汁，否则我会
搅拌砾石。

10:12.778 --> 10:14.113
What now?
现在怎么办？

10:14.196 --> 10:16.615
You know, lay a patch.
你知道，打个补丁。

10:16.699 --> 10:17.825
Excuse me?
打扰一下？

10:17.908 --> 10:20.494
Give me a raise or I'm quitting.
给我加薪，不然我就辞职。

10:20.578 --> 10:22.246
A "raise"?
“加薪”？

10:22.330 --> 10:24.123
Hmm, that's not
in my hiptionary.
嗯，那不是
在我的嘻哈词典中。

10:24.206 --> 10:25.791
Help me get with it, Jack.
帮我解决这个问题，杰克。

10:25.875 --> 10:29.211
Stop talking like that.
别再这样说话了。

10:29.295 --> 10:32.089
These sideburns aren't real.
这些鬓角不是真的。

10:32.173 --> 10:38.637
I need more money
in my paycheck at the end
of every week,  capisce?
我需要更多的钱
最后在我的薪水中
每周，capisce？

10:53.486 --> 10:56.322
my hair,
my beautiful hair.
我的头发，
我美丽的头发。

10:56.405 --> 10:59.825
Squidward: My hair, my hair.
章鱼哥：我的头发，我的头发。

11:02.661 --> 11:06.791
Ah, it's still as funny today
as it was then.
啊今天还是一样搞笑
就像当时一样。

11:10.169 --> 11:12.254
You see, SpongeBob.
你看，海绵宝宝。

11:12.338 --> 11:14.840
You've got one quality
Jim will never have.
你有一种品质
吉姆永远不会。

11:14.924 --> 11:16.342
You're cheap.
你很便宜。

11:16.425 --> 11:18.135
Wow, I never thought of it
that way.
哇，我从来没想过
那样。

11:18.219 --> 11:19.345
So you'll stay?
那么你会留下来吗？

11:19.428 --> 11:21.055
Aye-aye, Mr. Krabs.
是的，蟹老板先生。

11:21.138 --> 11:23.349
Then get to work, lad!
然后开始工作吧，小伙子！

11:23.432 --> 11:26.769
Well, Eugene, looks like you've
got yourself another sucker.
嗯，尤金，看起来你已经
又给自己找了一个傻瓜。

11:26.852 --> 11:28.062
The kid's a good fry cook
这孩子炒菜的手艺很好

11:28.145 --> 11:30.439
but he'll only be
a great fry cook
但他只会
一位出色的炒菜厨师

11:30.523 --> 11:33.275
when he finally
gets the guts to quit this dump.
当他终于
有勇气离开这个垃圾场。

11:33.359 --> 11:34.944
Good luck, SpongeBob.
祝你好运，海绵宝宝。

11:35.027 --> 11:37.905
You're gonna need it.
你会需要它。

11:37.988 --> 11:40.199
The Krusty Krab isn't a dump.
蟹堡王不是垃圾场。

11:40.282 --> 11:42.243
Oh, she's a dump, all right.
哦，她就是个废物，好吧。

11:42.326 --> 11:43.828
But she's my dump.
但她是我的垃圾。

11:43.911 --> 11:46.080
Oh...
哦...

11:56.715 --> 12:00.428
SpongeBob: "And slowly,
ever so slowly
海绵宝宝：“慢慢地，
如此缓慢地

12:00.511 --> 12:04.473
"the ancient crypt door
creaks open.
“古老的墓穴门
吱吱作响地打开了。

12:04.557 --> 12:07.768
"And from the festering brine
of the darkest darkness
“从溃烂的盐水中
最黑暗的黑暗

12:07.852 --> 12:11.230
"crawled forth monsters
of such vile nature
“怪物爬了出来
性质如此恶劣

12:11.313 --> 12:13.941
"whose appearance was so
hideous and threatening
“谁的外表如此
可怕且具有威胁性

12:14.024 --> 12:17.528
that the author  died
trying to recount them
in this novel!"
作者去世了
试图重述它们
在这本小说里！”

12:20.739 --> 12:23.742
But it's only a story,
right, Gary?
但这只是一个故事，
对吧，加里？

12:23.826 --> 12:27.371
Why don't you
sleep up here tonight, Gary?
你为什么不
今晚就睡在这里吗，加里？

12:29.165 --> 12:30.583
Well, I guess I'll be
turning off the light now.
好吧，我想我会
现在关灯。

12:35.796 --> 12:37.256
Sure is dark.
当然是黑暗了。

12:40.718 --> 12:42.511
SpongeBob: Oh, it's just
a chair.
海绵宝宝：哦，只是
一把椅子。

12:43.846 --> 12:45.598
I guess I'm imagining things
in the  dark.
我想我在想象一些事情
在黑暗中。

12:50.311 --> 12:52.229
SpongeBob: Another monster!
海绵宝宝：又一个怪物！

12:53.397 --> 12:56.108
Ah, it's just a coral branch.
啊，只是一根珊瑚树枝。

12:56.192 --> 12:58.694
Nothing to be scared of.
没什么好害怕的。

13:11.207 --> 13:13.626
Hey, Squidward,
have you seen SpongeBob?
嘿，章鱼哥，
你见过海绵宝宝吗？

13:16.754 --> 13:17.755
Whoa.
哇哦。

13:17.838 --> 13:18.797
You don't look so good, laddie.
你看起来不太好，小伙子。

13:18.881 --> 13:20.424
Oh, it's nothing, Mr. Krabs.
哦，没什么，蟹老板。

13:20.508 --> 13:22.384
I just had a rough night.
我刚刚度过了一个艰难的夜晚。

13:22.468 --> 13:24.386
But it's nice and bright today.
但今天天气很好，很明亮。

13:28.182 --> 13:29.350
Meanderin' mermaids.
蜿蜒的美人鱼。

13:29.433 --> 13:30.559
What's all this racket, boy?
小伙子，这到底是怎么回事？

13:30.643 --> 13:32.311
SpongeBob: Oh, oh, the dark!
海绵宝宝：噢，噢，黑暗！

13:32.394 --> 13:33.812
Get it off, get it off,
get it off, get it off!
脱下来，脱下来，
脱下来，脱下来！

13:33.896 --> 13:36.148
SpongeBob, get ahold
of yourself.
海绵宝宝，抱住
你自己。

13:39.568 --> 13:41.820
What is it now, boy?
现在怎么样了，孩子？

13:41.904 --> 13:45.115
Whenever I blink,
I see nothing but the darkness.
每当我眨眼的时候，
除了黑暗我什么也看不见。

13:45.199 --> 13:46.575
Then don't blink.
那就别眨眼。

13:47.576 --> 13:49.161
Brilliant idea, Mr. Krabs.
好主意，蟹老板。

13:49.245 --> 13:52.831
Yes, it's working.
是的，它正在工作。

13:55.125 --> 13:56.961
SpongeBob, that's enough!
海绵宝宝，够了！

13:57.044 --> 13:58.379
We've got 50 orders to fill.
我们有 50 个订单需要完成。

13:58.462 --> 14:00.839
Now go in the cooler
and get some fresh patties.
现在进入冷藏室
并买一些新鲜的肉饼。

14:00.923 --> 14:02.675
SpongeBob: You want me
to go in...
海绵宝宝：你想要我
进去...

14:08.931 --> 14:10.724
The darkness!
黑暗！

14:12.101 --> 14:13.352
Now look, lad.
现在看，小伙子。

14:13.435 --> 14:16.105
Your work is starting to
affect me profits.
你的工作开始了
影响我的利润。

14:16.188 --> 14:17.940
You need to get yourself
some shuteye.
你需要让自己
闭上眼睛。

14:18.023 --> 14:19.900
Why don't you go
get yourself a night light?
你为什么不走
给自己买一盏夜灯吗？

14:19.984 --> 14:21.819
Night light?
夜灯？

14:21.902 --> 14:23.237
Yeah, boy.
是的，男孩。

14:23.320 --> 14:25.322
It'll keep your room lit
so you won't be scared stiff.
它会让你的房间保持明亮
这样你就不会被吓得僵硬。

14:25.406 --> 14:27.366
Great idea, Mr. Krabs.
好主意，蟹老板。

14:29.451 --> 14:32.079
Night lights... Night lights...
夜灯……夜灯……

14:34.290 --> 14:36.792
It's beautiful.
很美丽。

14:36.875 --> 14:37.876
Excuse me.
打扰一下。

14:37.960 --> 14:39.878
Are these nightlights  guaranteed
这些夜灯有保证吗

14:39.962 --> 14:42.548
to keep the creepy creatures
of the dark away?
来保留那些令人毛骨悚然的生物
黑暗的远去？

14:47.386 --> 14:49.179
Now that I can see, whoo-hoo!
现在我能看到了，呼呼！

14:49.263 --> 14:51.223
I can sleep.
我可以睡觉了。

14:55.728 --> 14:57.187
I wonder what's in my dark,
scary-looking bathroom.
我想知道我的黑暗里有什么
看起来很吓人的浴室。

15:00.816 --> 15:02.401
Night light, night light!
小夜灯，小夜灯！

15:02.484 --> 15:04.486
Oh, thank you.
哦，谢谢。

15:06.363 --> 15:07.906
Whew.
呼。

15:10.326 --> 15:13.078
Oh, thank you.
哦，谢谢。

15:24.340 --> 15:27.843
There, there, there, and there.
那里，那里，那里，还有那里。

15:27.926 --> 15:30.095
I've been meaning to change
your tail light anyway, Gary.
我一直想改变
无论如何，你的尾灯，加里。

15:31.597 --> 15:33.265
Now there's not
one square inch of dark.
现在没有了
一平方英寸的黑暗。

15:33.349 --> 15:34.224
Meow.
喵。

15:34.308 --> 15:35.100
What was that Gary?
那个加里是什么？

15:35.184 --> 15:36.894
Meow.
喵。

15:41.649 --> 15:45.611
I've got darkness inside of me!
我的内心充满了黑暗！

15:52.534 --> 15:55.412
Hey, SpongeBob's having
a party without me?
嘿，海绵宝宝有
没有我的聚会？

15:57.081 --> 16:00.626
Throw a party without
your best friend,
we'll see about that-augh!
Throw a party without
your best friend,
我们拭目以待吧——噢！

16:00.709 --> 16:02.461
That was close, Patrick.
很接近了，帕特里克。

16:02.544 --> 16:04.296
You're safe here
under these night lights.
你在这里很安全
在这些夜灯下。

16:04.380 --> 16:06.632
But you gotta stay out of
the dark, buddy!
但你必须远离
黑暗，伙计！

16:06.715 --> 16:11.136
You never know what kind
of creeping critter could
be lurking in those shadows.
你永远不知道哪种
爬行动物可以
潜伏在那些阴影中。

16:13.055 --> 16:14.390
Wait, Patrick!
等等，帕特里克！

16:17.142 --> 16:19.728
What is that, Gary?
那是什么，加里？

16:24.441 --> 16:27.945
Patrick, what are you doing?
帕特里克，你在做什么？

16:28.028 --> 16:32.616
Oh, I had to move my rock
out of the dark and into
the light.
哦，我必须移动我的石头
走出黑暗并进入
光。

16:32.700 --> 16:33.951
You know what that means...
你知道这意味着什么...

16:34.618 --> 16:38.247
Sleep over!
睡过去吧！

16:38.330 --> 16:39.331
Your sleeping bag, sir.
你的睡袋，先生。

16:39.415 --> 16:43.085
Thank you, my good man.
谢谢你，我的好人。

16:51.051 --> 16:55.222
oh, Patrick, I'm so glad
you made that gaping hole
in the wall.
哦，帕特里克，我很高兴
你造成了那个大洞
在墙上。

16:55.305 --> 16:56.348
Letting in all the-th-th-th...
让所有的第...

16:56.432 --> 16:59.309
the dark!
黑暗！

17:18.454 --> 17:21.373
Burning, augh!
燃烧啊啊啊！

17:27.546 --> 17:29.423
I can feel it, Pat,
the darkness.
我能感觉到，帕特，
黑暗。

17:29.506 --> 17:32.676
Like it's creeping up on us.
就像它正在向我们蔓延一样。

17:32.760 --> 17:35.137
What are you two
whimpering about?
你们两个是什么
呜咽着什么？

17:36.889 --> 17:39.933
it's me, Squidward, you idiots.
是我，章鱼哥，你们这些白痴。

17:40.017 --> 17:40.726
Hi, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

17:40.809 --> 17:42.352
Listen, guys.
听着，伙计们。

17:42.436 --> 17:45.731
I don't care or want to know
what you do in your spare time
我不在乎也不想知道
你业余时间做什么

17:45.814 --> 17:48.525
but could you
turn off all these lights?
但你可以吗
关掉所有这些灯？

17:48.609 --> 17:50.903
But Squidward,
without our night lights
但是章鱼哥，
没有我们的夜灯

17:50.986 --> 17:52.946
the creepy creatures
of the dark...
令人毛骨悚然的生物
黑暗的...

17:53.030 --> 17:56.492
Oh, SpongeBob, there are no
"creepy creatures of the dark."
哦，海绵宝宝，没有
“黑暗中令人毛骨悚然的生物。”

17:56.575 --> 18:00.621
It's all in your imagination.
这一切都在你的想象中。

18:00.704 --> 18:02.247
No, Squidward!
不，章鱼哥！

18:02.331 --> 18:03.415
Don't go out in the dark!
天黑的时候不要出去！

18:05.667 --> 18:08.462
Oh, why won't he listen?
哦，他为什么不听？

18:08.545 --> 18:11.924
Patrick, maybe
Squidward's right.
帕特里克，也许
章鱼哥是对的。

18:12.007 --> 18:13.926
What if all this  is
just in our imagination?
如果这一切都是怎么办
只是在我们的想象中吗？

18:14.009 --> 18:15.385
In that case,
we'll need even more lights.
在那种情况下，
我们需要更多的灯。

18:15.469 --> 18:18.430
You said it, Pat.
你说过了，帕特。

18:23.352 --> 18:24.061
Quick, SpongeBob.
快点，海绵宝宝。

18:24.144 --> 18:25.354
Turn it on.
打开它。

18:27.481 --> 18:29.983
More light!
更轻！

18:31.568 --> 18:33.195
Now, SpongeBob!
现在，海绵宝宝！

18:36.198 --> 18:37.866
More light!
更轻！

18:48.836 --> 18:52.214
Man: The battery-operated spoon
has saved me so much time.
男：电池供电的勺子
节省了我很多时间。

18:54.174 --> 18:57.427
This is what passes for
info-tainment these days?
这就是所谓的
现在的信息娱乐？

18:57.511 --> 19:00.222
Sweet mother of
Neptune's mother!
甜蜜的妈妈
海王星的母亲！

19:00.305 --> 19:02.057
Look, Barnacle Boy!
看，藤壶男孩！

19:02.140 --> 19:04.560
A call to action!
号召大家行动起来！

19:04.643 --> 19:07.354
To the invisible boat mobile.
向隐形船移动。

19:09.231 --> 19:11.066
More lights, SpongeBob.
更多灯光，海绵宝宝。

19:11.149 --> 19:13.110
More lights.
更多的灯。

19:13.193 --> 19:14.319
Mermaid Man!
人鱼男！

19:14.403 --> 19:16.363
Barnacle Boy!
藤壶男孩！

19:16.446 --> 19:19.992
Aw, are you guys here
to protect us from the darkness
that surrounds us?
噢，你们在吗？
保护我们免受黑暗的侵害
我们周围的？

19:20.075 --> 19:22.911
We don't have time
for your childish games.
我们没有时间
为了你幼稚的游戏。

19:22.995 --> 19:26.248
We're responding to the distress
signal that you sent.
我们正在应对困境
您发送的信号。

19:27.666 --> 19:31.044
Oh, I'm sorry,
Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy.
哦，对不起，
美人鱼人和藤壶男孩。

19:31.128 --> 19:33.630
There appears to be
a misunderstanding.
似乎有
一个误会。

19:33.714 --> 19:38.343
You see, Patrick and I put up
all these lights to scare away
the monsters in the dark.
你看，帕特里克和我忍受了
所有这些灯光都吓跑了
黑暗中的怪物。

19:38.427 --> 19:40.387
We weren't trying to summon you.
我们并不是想召唤你。

19:40.470 --> 19:42.931
Oh, fiddlesticks, SpongeBob.
哦，小提琴手，海绵宝宝。

19:43.015 --> 19:49.479
Do you know how hard it is
for us, in our advanced age,
to move?
你知道这有多难吗
对于年事已高的我们来说，
移动？

19:49.563 --> 19:53.859
Don't shine a giant light
in the sky unless there's
a real emergency.
不要发出巨大的光
在天空中除非有
真正的紧急情况。

20:04.828 --> 20:06.622
And another thing...
还有一件事...

20:06.705 --> 20:07.956
What the?
什么？

20:11.710 --> 20:13.503
Dear Neptune!
亲爱的海王星！

20:13.587 --> 20:18.759
It's the most dangerous
and foreboding of all
our arch-nemesis!
这是最危险的
以及一切的预感
我们的宿敌！

20:18.842 --> 20:24.556
My mortal enemy that I have
searched 57 years for!
我的死敌
寻找了57年！

20:24.640 --> 20:26.600
At last I have you!
我终于拥有你了！

20:28.769 --> 20:31.772
Come get some, fiend.
来吧，恶魔。

20:37.444 --> 20:40.405
Come back here, rival!
回来吧，对手！

20:48.288 --> 20:49.289
Oh, my!
哦，天哪！

20:49.373 --> 20:50.749
Mermaid Man needs assistance.
美人鱼人需要帮助。

20:50.832 --> 20:53.710
There's no need to fear,
AbsorboPants is here.
没有必要害怕，
AbsorboPants 在这里。

21:03.345 --> 21:04.513
Savory light.
咸味的光。

21:04.596 --> 21:06.682
Come to me...
到我这里来...

21:06.765 --> 21:07.641
Huh?
啊？

21:07.724 --> 21:09.851
Say, let me help you.
说吧，我来帮你吧。

21:13.605 --> 21:15.440
Is that enough light for you?
这对你来说足够吗？

21:20.278 --> 21:23.323
O.K., guys,
he's all taken care of.
好吧，伙计们，
他都被照顾好了。

21:23.407 --> 21:24.116
Who?
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？
世界卫生组织？

21:24.199 --> 21:25.283
The moth, silly.
飞蛾啊，傻啊。

21:25.367 --> 21:27.244
Your arch-enemy.
你的宿敌。

21:27.327 --> 21:29.663
You'll be happy to know
he won't be going anywhere
any time soon.
你会很高兴知道
他不会去任何地方
很快。

21:37.671 --> 21:41.133
See you in  another  57 years.
再过57年再见。

21:45.053 --> 21:46.930
No...!
不...！

21:47.556 --> 21:50.267
I think it's time to go home.
我想是时候回家了。

21:50.350 --> 21:52.144
Why are we here again?
我们怎么又来了？

21:52.227 --> 21:54.062
Bye, Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy.
再见，人鱼男
和藤壶男孩。

21:54.146 --> 21:58.066
Who are those two hideous
creatures of the dark?
那两个丑陋的人是谁
黑暗生物？

21:58.150 --> 22:00.318
Oh, I'll tell you about it
in the morning.
哦，我会告诉你这件事
早上。

22:00.402 --> 22:03.613
Now, drive.
现在，开车吧。

22:03.697 --> 22:05.949
We are all alone, Patrick.
我们都很孤独，帕特里克。

22:06.033 --> 22:07.409
No light, no shelter.
没有光，没有庇护所。

22:14.249 --> 22:16.251
Huh?
啊？

22:16.334 --> 22:17.377
Look, SpongeBob.
看，海绵宝宝。

22:17.461 --> 22:19.337
There's a really big light.
确实有一个很大的光。

22:19.421 --> 22:22.716
I'll go get it, buddy.
我去拿它，伙计。

22:26.428 --> 22:27.346
SpongeBob: Pat!
海绵宝宝：帕特！

22:27.429 --> 22:31.141
Come ba...
来吧...

22:31.224 --> 22:34.519
Too much light! Too much light!
光线太多！光线太多！

22:34.603 --> 22:37.314
Patrick:
帕特里克：

帕特里克：